            "heading": "What furniture is included in the COLAMY clearance sale?",
            "content": "<p>COLAMY clearance sale items may include recliners, massage chairs, electric standing desks, ergonomic office chairs, dining chairs, bar stools, and other select home furniture. Availability changes based on inventory, so check the clearance collection often for the latest deals.</p>",
